<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PPT Vision cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PPT Vision cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded PPT Vision Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3/8 to 7-3/4.</p>
</text>
